class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-muted-foreground/70" style="left:15.789473684210526%">5K</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-muted-foreground/70" style="left:31.57894736842105%">20K</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-foreground" style="left:42.10526315789473%">40K</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-muted-foreground/70" style="left:57.89473684210527%">100K</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-muted-foreground/70" style="left:78.94736842105263%">400K</span><span class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-[10px] transition-colors text-muted-foreground/70" style="left:100%">1M</span></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Increase email volume" class="border-foreground/25 text-foreground hover:border-foreground/45 hover:bg-secondary focus-visible:ring-ring flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-3.5"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></button></div></div><p aria-live="polite" class="text-muted-foreground flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-sm"><span>Best match</span><span class="text-foreground font-medium">Creator</span><span class="font-display text-foreground text-2xl leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] tabular-nums">$20</span><span>/month</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">for<!-- --> <!-- -->40K<!-- --> <!-- -->emails</span></p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><div class="bg-card flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border px-6 py-8 sm:px-7 sm:py-10 border-border"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-foreground text-sm font-medium">Free</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-display text-foreground text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] tabular-nums">$0</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">/month</span></div></div><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Everything working end to end, for nothing.</p><a href="/start" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 text-sm font-medium transition-[color,background-color,transform] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:outline-none active:scale-[0.97] motion-reduce:active:scale-100 sm:min-h-10 border border-border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-secondary w-full py-2 text-center">Start free</a><ul class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg>3,000 emails/month included</li><li class="text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg>No overage. The send simply stops</li><li class="text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground mt-0.5 size-3.5