x-auto w-full max-w-[1190px] px-6 lg:px-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4"><p class="bg-marketing-lime text-foreground inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bg-foreground size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full"></span>Everything included</p><h2 class="font-display text-foreground text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.03em] text-balance sm:text-[2.25rem] max-w-3xl">22 things you get on every plan.<!-- --> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Free included.</span></h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty max-w-xl">No feature paywall. You pay for emails delivered. The product is the same on every plan.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-muted flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl p-6"><p class="text-foreground text-sm font-medium">Pricing that doesn&#x27;t punish you</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Unlimited subscribers, no per-contact pricing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Unlimited lists, tags and segments</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Unlimited campaigns and broadcasts</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">No line on the invoice for list size</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Dormant contacts cost you nothing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">3,000 emails a month free, no card</span></li></ul></div><div class="bg-muted flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl p-6"><p class="text-foreground text-sm font-medium">The whole product, on day one</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Visual workflow builder with branches and goals</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">A/B test any step of a sequence</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">AI-assisted editor</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Variables and conditional blocks</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Plain-text and HTML from one draft</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Capture pages on your own domain</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Filter builder for segments</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Inbox preview before you send</span></li></ul></div><div class="bg-muted flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl p-6"><p class="text-foreground text-sm font-medium">Agents and sending</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Your AI can draft, segment and send</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">REST API, TypeScript SDK and CLI</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">SMTP relay at smtp.lumail.io:587</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Transactional email on a separate instant lane</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Guided SPF, DKIM and DMARC setup</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Activity log for every action</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">Open, click and conversion analytics</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground/70 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"></path></svg><span class="text-muted-foreground leading-5">CSV import with no list-size fee</span></li></ul></div></div><p class="border-border bg-card mt-4 rounded-xl border px-6 py-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">Paid plans add: </span><span class="text-foreground/80">The “Sent with Lumail” badge switches off · Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription · More seats, more domains, more AI conversations</span></p></div></section><section class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-border"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1190px] px-6 lg:px-10 flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div class="max-w-xl"><h2 class="font-display text-foreground text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.03em] text-balance sm:text-[2.25rem]">Contacts, sends, revenue share, or add-ons?</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty mt-3">Compare Lumail pricing with newsletter, marketing, and API email platforms using current official prices.</p></div><a href="/compare" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 text-sm font-medium transition-[color,background-color,transform] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:outline-none active:scale-[0.97] motion-reduce:active:scale-100 sm:min-h-10 border border-border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-secondary">Compare every platform</a></div></section><section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-muted"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1190px] px-6 lg:px-10"><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3"><figure class="bg-card flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.05),0_8px_24px_-16px_rgb(0_0_0/0.15)] sm:p-8"><blockquote class="font-display text-foreground text-xl leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance">“<!-- -->Lumail made me like email. It turned email from a side thing into the main marketing channel for my Linkhub business.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src="/images/testimonials/yannis.webp" alt="Yannis" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-10 rounded-full object-cover"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="text-foreground text-sm">Yannis</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Founder, Linkhub</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class="bg-card flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.05),0_8px_24px_-16px_rgb(0_0_0/0.15)] sm:p-8"><blockquote class="font-display text-foreground text-xl leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance">“<!-- -->I&#x27;m not a marketer, but email is powerful. Thanks to the Codex integration, Codex actually implements all the marketing for me.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src="/images/testimonials/nicolas.webp" alt="Nicolas" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-10 rounded-full object-cover"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="text-foreground text-sm">Nicolas</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Indie founder</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class="bg-card flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.05),0_8px_24px_-16px_rgb(0_0_0/0.15)] sm:p-8"><blockquote class="font-display text-foreground text-xl leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance">“<!-- -->I was using MailerLite and sending emails was a constant stress. Now my agent reviews it, fixes it, and sends it for me. I&#x27;ve sent over 3 million emails with Lumail.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src="/images/testimonials/melvyn.webp" alt="Melvyn" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-10 rounded-full object-cover"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="text-foreground text-sm">Melvyn</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">melvynx.com · 3M+ emails sent</span></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-border border-t"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1190px] px-6 lg:px-10"><div class="border-border grid gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-card flex flex-col justify-center gap-5 p-6 sm:p-10"><p class="bg-marketing-lime text-foreground inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bg-foreground size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full"></span>Ask AI</p><h2 class="font-display text-foreground tracking-[-0.03em] text-balance text-2xl sm:text-[2rem]">Don&#x27;t take our word for it.</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty max-w-md">Pick the question you actually have. We hand it to the assistant you already trust.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none bg-primary text-primary-foreground border-transparent">Is it right for me?</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">How does it compare?</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">What would it cost me?</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none border-border text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">Can my AI run it?</button></div></div><div class="bg-muted flex flex-col gap-4 p-6 sm:p-10"><p class="text-muted-foreground line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-6">“<!-- -->I run a newsletter and I&#x27;m considering Lumail (lumail.io) for it. Read their site and tell me honestly who Lumail is a good fit for, who it is a bad fit for, and what I should check before switching.<!-- -->”</p><div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2"><a href="https://chatgpt.com/?hints=search&amp;q=I%20run%20a%20newsletter%20and%20I&#x27;m%20considering%20Lumail%20(lumail.io)%20for%20it.%20Read%20their%20site%20and%20tell%20me%20honestly%20who%20Lumail%20is%20a%20good%20fit%20for%2C%20who%20it%20is%20a%20bad%20fit%20for%2C%20and%20what%20I%20should%20check%20before%20switching." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="group border-border bg-card hover:border-primary/40 focus-visible:ring-ring flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg border px-3 text-left focus-visible:ring